OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal to unlawfully at
OL,4,Alarge murderer to hand himself in
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information to
OL,7,Fhelp locate a prisoner who is
OL,8,Funlawfully at large.
OL,10,FGary Anderson, 29, is one of two men
OL,11,Fwho were sentenced for the murder of
OL,12,FKarol Kelly in 2023.
OL,14,FHe had been on day release from
OL,15,FMaghaberry prison on Monday.
OL,17,F"As of this time, Gary - who is
OL,18,Fapproximately five feet 11 inches tall,
OL,19,Fof slim build and with brown hair - has
OL,20,Fstill not returned to prison or been
OL,21,Fapprehended," the PSNI said.
